    "Destination-agnostic: cross-team transferring returners are projected against a destination-blind prior. Documented in \u00a75c.",
    "Recruit-rank deferred: ablation experiment runs after historical recruit ingest (class-of-2021\u20132025 backfill).",
    "Selection bias on returners: only includes players who returned for N+1; doesn't model the leave-for-draft cohort."
  ]
}